  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Rights Defenders - Human Rights and HR-defenders - Civil Rights Defenders - Human Rights and HR-defenders NS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civil Rights Defenders - M&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttighter och MR-f&#xf6;rsvarare</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the situation for Human Rights defenders at risk, in the project area, particularly with regards to their security situation and the impact of their work.

This will be achieved through a series of intermediate (or specific) objectives:

OUTCOME 1: A continuous exchange of information on the human rights situation through a strong network of local actors on the two sides of the border.

OUTCOME 2: Improved capacity among local actors on both sides of the border to document, report, and use data on Human Rights violations.

OUTCOME 3: Increased national and international attention to the Human Rights situation in the border area

OUTCOME 4: Increased security for local actor</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta projektst&#xf6;d till m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsorganisationer och m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare &#xe4;r inriktat p&#xe5; p&#xe5;verkan, s&#xe4;kerhet och samarbete f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka m&#xf6;jligheterna till fred och h&#xe5;llbar utveckling i konfliktdrabbade regioner. Projektet har fyra resultat:

1) Ett kontinuerligt informationsutbyte om m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttssituationen genom ett starkt n&#xe4;tverk av lokala akt&#xf6;rer.
2) F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad kapacitet hos lokala akt&#xf6;rer att dokumentera, rapportera och anv&#xe4;nda uppgifter om kr&#xe4;nkningar av de m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheterna.
3) &#xd6;kad nationell och internationell uppm&#xe4;rksamhet p&#xe5; m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttssituationen i Arauca.
4) &#xd6;kad s&#xe4;kerhet f&#xf6;r lokala akt&#xf6;rer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project support to Human Rights organisations and Human Rights defenders targets impact, security, and cooperation in order to increase the possibilities for peace and sustainable development in conflict-affected regions. The project has four outcomes:

1) A continuous exchange of information on the human rights situation through a strong network of local actors.
2) Improved capacity among local actors to document, report, and use data on Human Rights violations.
3) Increased national and international attention to the human rights situation in Arauca.
4) Increased security for local actors.</narrative>
  </description>
